# Virtuoso VR -> Moduleur Bridge

VR davulundan analog modular synth'e!

```
[Quest - Virtuoso VR] --OSC UDP 9003--> [bridge_server.py] --WebSocket 8765--> [Web UI] --WebMIDI--> [Brain Pico] --CV/Gate--> [Moduleur]
```

## Kurulum

```bash
pip install python-osc websockets
```

## Çalıştır

Terminal 1 - Bridge:
```bash
python bridge_server.py
```

Terminal 2 - Web UI:
```bash
python -m http.server 8000
# tarayicida http://localhost:8000
```

Quest'te:
- Virtuoso > Track Settings > Enable Remote Control
- Remote IP = bilgisayarinin IP'si (ipconfig / ifconfig)
- Veya Autoconnect kullan

## Mapping

| Virtuoso | Moduleur |
|----------|----------|
| Board note | VCO Pitch 1V/oct |
| Rimba velocity | VCF Cutoff CC74 |
| Wavemin X/Y/Z | VCO Coarse/Fine/Wave |
| Ctrl 1-4 | ADSR |
| Ctrl 5-6 | Mixer |

## Dosyalar

- `bridge_server.py` - OSC to WebSocket bridge
